==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|es|Guatemala}} (originally the name of [[Iximche]], the location of Guatemala's first capital), from {{der|en|nci|Cuauhtēmallān}}, from {{m|nci|cuauhtēmalli|t=woodpile}} + {{m|nci|-tlān|t=place}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌɡwɑː.təˈmɑː.lə/|a=UK,US}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Soundguys-Guatemala.wav|a=UK}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-Guatemala.ogg|a=US}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

